  "description": "The 2021 ATT 9.8 Ltd uses a high modulus C10 Carbon frame and fork resulting from years of extensive research and development to deliver outstanding aerodynamic performance. Deep, box-section chainstays ensure excellent power transfer, meaning none of your effort is wasted. A stunning 9.8 Ltd paint scheme in metallic black and brushed titanium give the bike the looks to match its speed. Bottle cage mounts on the top tube for a bento box give an extra option for storing food or spares on longer rides.\n\nA carbon, aero-profile seatpost with 4 saddle clamp positions and a highly adjustable Zipp Vuka Alumina cockpit means it is super easy to get your body into an aerodynamic and efficient position. When 80% of the overall drag comes from the rider themselves, this is crucially important. The Fizik Mistica saddle allows for a low, aggressive position with plenty of comfort too.\n\nShimano’s reliable 105 derailleurs combine with Dura Ace bar-end shifters giving precise shifting, even in the midst of an all-out effort, and 25mm Vittoria Zaffiro Slick tyres offer a great blend of comfort, speed and grip.\n\nThis high-performing aerodymanic frame and quality specification makes the ATT 9.8 Ltd the perfect entry point into dedicated Time Trial and Triathlon machines.\n\nKey Highlights\n\nHighly aerodynamic high modulus C10 Carbon frame and fork\n\nWide range of positional adjustment to optimise efficiency\n\nQuality Shimano Dura Ace / 105 shifting",
